  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Hepatica - st&#xf6;d genom PAO-strategin 2024-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hepatica 2024-2027 - special Democracy Support through PAO - Hepatica 2024-2027 - special Democracy Support through PAO - Grundbidrag</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Hepatica har inkommit med verksamhetsplan och budget i enlighet med strategin f&#xf6;r de partianknutna organisationerna, 2024 - 2027 och den v&#xe4;gledning som Sida beslutat om (Dox dokumentnummer 24/000321 -2) Den f&#xf6;reslagna verksamheten och budgeten inneh&#xe5;ller information i enlighet med Sidas beslutade v&#xe4;gledning.

Hepatica f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;r verksamhet f&#xf6;r perioden 2024-2027 inom tv&#xe5; program, med projekt i ett antal l&#xe4;nder. Programmen &#xe4;r t&#xe4;nkta att l&#xf6;pa &#xf6;ver hela strategiperioden, men l&#xe4;ngden p&#xe5; enskilda projekt inom programmen kan variera. Hepatica befinner sig i ett uppbyggnadsskede och kommer d&#xe4;rf&#xf6;r i inledningsfasen att delta i redan befintliga projekt som deras samarbetsparter bedriver. Ut&#xf6;ver de tv&#xe5; programmen &#xf6;ppnar Hepatica upp f&#xf6;r m&#xf6;jligheten att i framtiden bedriva enskilda projekt i andra l&#xe4;nder. Till dessa eventuella framtida projekt finns i nul&#xe4;get dock ingen budget kopplad.
F&#xf6;rutom lokala samarbetsparter i enskilda projekt finns tre t&#xe4;nkta program&#xf6;vergripande partner International Republican Institute (IRI), Konrad Adenauer Stiftung (KAS) och tankesmedjan Oikos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hepatica has submitted a plan and budget in accordance with the strategy for the party-affiliated organizations, 2024 - 2027 and the guidance decided by Sida (Dox document number 24/000321 -2) The proposed activities and budget contain information in accordance with Sida&apos;s decided guidance.

Hepatica proposes activities for the period 2024-2027 within two programs, with projects in a number of countries. The programs are intended to run over the entire strategy period, but the length of individual projects within the programs may vary. Hepatica is in an organizational build-up phase and will therefore, in the initial phase, participate in already existing projects carried out by their partners. In addition to the two programs, Hepatica opens up the possibility of conducting individual projects in other countries in the future. However, there is currently no budget attached to these possible future projects.
In addition to local partners in individual projects, there are three envisaged program-wide partners, the International Republican Institute (IRI), the Konrad Adenauer Stiftung (KAS) and the think tank Oikos.</narrative>
  </description>
